{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1291431207"}, "name":{"label":"JoyLain"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-19T03:53:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.77.0"}, "id":{"label":"10839131896"}, "title":{"label":"Usefull yet deceiving"}, "content":{"label":"The app offers a multitute of different options and programs, while accompanied with a charming easy to navigate interface.\n\nSome of the offered programs are challenges to reduce coffee intake, alcohol intake, or even overly sweet drinks,\nyou can also messure these out in your daily liquid intake, even better with the help of a widget.\nOr different cosmetics to spice up the users experience.\n\nThe only problem is :\nThings that should be free and helpful to people, and basic things that normally would create a lot of on app engagements is completely locked behind a paywall.\nAll while the fee is pretty small and modest, and a fee applied to cosmetics does make sense as it doesn't negatively impact users experience, it doesn't really make sense to core elements like the different liquid options.\n\nThe app then becomes if anything a cutified version of any free and available program out there.\nSure the program is easy to use and does look great, but it doesn't really try to make itself any different in any other regard and the options that could come handy to make it unique is blocked outright by the paywall.\n\nApplications such as Lifesum which are dieting managers does everything WaterLlama does without a fee (and without a cute mascot).\n\nIt does raise a few eyebrows about where the devs stands and it is kind of self aware all the whilst delusional.\nWhen about to pay, if you change your mind you will be greeted with a screen telling you \"Premium users are 91% more likely to stay hydrated!\" \nWeirdly odd statistic, inaccurate and unclear sampling method, if anything maybe people simply deinstalled the app for a free experience without the mascot.\n\nThe applications is nothing but dubious at best.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
